===== MUTATION 1: the per-value output-safety checks read the --json output =====
Round-7 F2 asked for a separate, falsifiable assertion per credential value. Pointing the three
github-actions stdout counts at the --json output — the format 08b asserts prints every detected
value verbatim — must break 08h, 08i and 08j. It is pointed at --json and not at the default
output deliberately: 08a records that the default output does NOT carry the AWS secret key, so a
default-output mutation would leave 08j passing and would prove nothing about it.
   replaced: G_PAT=$(vcount github-pat "$WORK/g.out")
         by: G_PAT=$(vcount github-pat "$WORK/j.out")
   replaced: G_AKIA=$(vcount aws-access-key-id "$WORK/g.out")
         by: G_AKIA=$(vcount aws-access-key-id "$WORK/j.out")
   replaced: G_SK=$(vcount aws-secret-access-key "$WORK/g.out")
         by: G_SK=$(vcount aws-secret-access-key "$WORK/j.out")
